# Browser requests stay on the frontend origin; Vite proxies /api/v1 to Docker.
# These defaults work with localhost:5173 and the existing local API service:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
# VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:18082
# Open localhost consistently during cookie testing (do not mix with 127.0.0.1).
# For local SSO set PUBLIC_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5173 in ignored deployments/.env
# and register http://localhost:5173/api/v1/auth/sso/keycloak/callback in local Keycloak.
# See docs/features/frontend-local-login/README.md for runtime registration steps.
# Backend deployment settings belong in deployments/.env; frontend .env holds VITE_* only.
